{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/472226-expending-experience-coils-and-styles","id":472226,"title":"Expending Experience: Coils and Styles","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-07T22:37:47-07:00","id":472226,"title":"Expending Experience: Coils and Styles","content":"First time poster and I've browsed these forums a fair bit for answers to this particular question, but found nothing thus far, so I thought it fair to ask. If it HAS been answered elsewhere, I'd appreciate being directed to the applicable post.<br /> <br /> My question: Do I understand the expending of experience correctly for Style merits in that each step of a style has to be bought individually, so that the total expenditure of exp from 1 to 5 dots in a five dot style (such as Parkour) is 15 exp (1+2+3+4+5)? And are the Coils of the Dragon purchased in the same manner, such that learning say Conquer the Red Fear (three dots) costs 9 exp within-mystery?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5590-osric-the-red","name":"Osric The Red","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-07T22:56:09-07:00","id":472251,"title":"","content":"The listed cost is for a dot whether it is the first or fifth. The Coil costs 3 experience. The Merit costs 1. It would be 9 total when buying the Coil 1, 2, and 3. It would be 5 when buying all five dots of a style at once. This is different than previous editions which would have worked as you were thinking.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1526-diggs","name":"Diggs","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"986"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T01:10:13-07:00","id":472355,"title":"","content":"Nwod did away with exponential experience costs. So 1 of X costs 'blank' experience no matter if it is the first dot or not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-08T02:17:45-07:00","id":472446,"title":"","content":"Use google to search for stuff in the forums. <a href=\"http://lmgtfy.com/?q=site%3Ahttp%3A%2F%2Fforum.theonyxpath.com%2F+experience+costs&amp;l=1\" target=\"_blank\">http://lmgtfy.com/?q=site%3Ahttp%3A%...ence+costs&amp;l=1</a><br /> <br /> It's the very first thing on the search <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B5_EJSgV1u4SOFFJc3M5VmFDWVk?resourcekey=0-GEErNnDbGqlKYgoiuGausw&amp;usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My Bloodline conversions</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1IbeKfqhWuG8jPN9vpGmDo0VY9n9-4ejxvRzfJRoir4k/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">My House rules</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/294-griautis","name":"Griautis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar294_